  "pages": {
    "index.html": {
      "settings": {
        "main": true,
        "title": "Solscan - Solana Token Traker",
        "meta_descr": "Explore the Solana blockchain with Solscan – track transactions, monitor wallets, analyze tokens, and view validator performance in real-time.",
        "header_custom": "",
        "footer_custom": "",
        "html_before": ""
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "img": {
              "object-fit": "contain",
              "border-radius": "0 !important"
            }
          },
          "_name": "image04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image03\" group=\"Image & Video\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Caption\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"image-block m-auto\">\n        <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/solscan.png\" alt=\"solscan \"></a>\n        <div mbr-if=\"showText\">\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mt-4 pb-4 align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                Unlock your true path!\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vjvmpf7CnX",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "image04-0"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".card-wrapper": {
              "background": "@wrapBgColor",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article07",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article07\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">\n            <b><a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>- Solana Token Traker</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b><a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan</a>: Solana Blockchain with Clarity and Speed</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">In the rapidly evolving world of blockchain and decentralized finance (DeFi), transparency and accessibility are paramount. For users and developers in the Solana ecosystem, <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan.io</a> has emerged as one of the most indispensable tools, offering a comprehensive way to explore, monitor, and analyze blockchain activity.<br><br><b>What is <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan</a>?<br></b><a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>is a blockchain explorer designed specifically for the Solana network. Similar to Ethereum’s Etherscan, it allows users to track transactions, view wallet addresses, inspect smart contracts, and monitor token activity in real-time. By providing a user-friendly interface combined with detailed data analytics, Solscan makes it easier for both novice and experienced users to navigate Solana’s fast-growing ecosystem.<br><br><b>Key Features of <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan</a></b><br><b>1. Transaction Tracking :-<br></b><a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>enables users to trace every transaction on the Solana network. From sending SOL tokens to interacting with DeFi protocols, each action is recorded transparently. Users can check transaction confirmations, fees, and even the transaction’s exact path across the blockchain.<br><br><b>2. Wallet and Token Analysis :-<br></b>Users can explore wallet addresses to see holdings, historical activity, and token balances. <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>also tracks token creation and transfers, offering insights into token distribution and popularity.<br><br><b>3. Smart Contract Exploration :-<br></b>Developers and auditors can examine smart contracts deployed on Solana, inspect program IDs, and analyze contract interactions. This transparency is crucial for ensuring trust and security in the ecosystem.<br><br><b>4. Staking and Validator Insights :-<br></b>Solana relies on a Proof-of-Stake (PoS) consensus mechanism. <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>provides detailed information about validators, including performance metrics, commission rates, and staking participation, helping delegators make informed decisions.<br><br><b>5. User-Friendly Interface and Charts :-<br></b>The platform includes visual tools such as charts, graphs, and leaderboards that track token performance, transaction trends, and network activity, making blockchain data more accessible and interpretable.<br><br><b>Why Solscan is Popular<br></b><a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan.io</a> popularity stems from its combination of speed, reliability, and comprehensiveness. The Solana network is known for its high throughput and low transaction costs, which can sometimes make tracking activity challenging. Solscan bridges this gap by delivering real-time data in a structured and intuitive way.<br><br>Moreover, its open accessibility ensures that anyone—from casual users to enterprise developers—can verify transactions and monitor the health of the Solana network, reinforcing trust in the ecosystem.<br><br><b>Practical Uses of <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan</a><br>.&nbsp; For Traders: </b>Quickly confirm token transfers and wallet activity.<br><b>.&nbsp; For Developers:</b> Debug smart contracts and monitor program interactions.<br><b>.&nbsp; For Investors:</b> Track token distribution and identify top holders.<br><b>.&nbsp; For Validators:</b> Monitor staking performance and network participation.<br><br><b>The Future of <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan</a><br></b>As the Solana network continues to grow, <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>is poised to evolve alongside it. Potential enhancements include deeper analytics for NFTs, more advanced DeFi tracking tools, and integration with other blockchain data sources. By continuing to provide transparency and real-time insights, Solscan will remain a cornerstone of the Solana ecosystem.<br><br><b>Conclusion :-</b><br>In an era where blockchain activity is increasingly complex, <a href=\"https://solscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Solscan </a>serves as a beacon of clarity for the Solana network. By combining transparency, speed, and usability, it empowers users and developers alike to engage confidently with the blockchain. Whether you are a casual user, a serious trader, or a developer building the next decentralized app (dApp), Solscan is an essential tool for exploring and understanding Solana.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n          </div>\n          <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vjvmqqg7an",
          "_anchor": "article07-1",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    }
  }
